  "releaseNotes": "v3.1 — Async interface for IModbus/IRelayController/IDevice with CancellationToken & async report; new DriverCodec shared codec (HEX/ASCII/UTF8/Json); zero-allocation hot paths in DataHelper/TypeHelper; serial/network driver concurrency & timeout fixes; 130+ new tests, 372 all pass.  v3.1 — IModbus/IRelayController/IDevice接口异步化，支持取消令牌与异步上报；新增DriverCodec共享编解码助手；采集热点路径零分配化；修复串口/网络驱动并发安全与超时缺陷；新增130+单元测试全部通过。",
